{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25559","headline":"六叹 三 · 李涉","name":"六叹 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉臣一没丁零塞，牧羊西过阴沙外。\n朝凭南鴈信难回，夜望北辰心独在。\n汉家茅土横九州，高门长戟封王侯。\n但将钟鼓悦私爱，肯以犬羊爲国羞。\n夜宿寒云卧冰雪，严风触刃垂旌节。\n丁年奉使白头归，泣尽李陵衣上血。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李涉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}